= Parkland

Seventeen students and teachers were killed in a school shooting in Parkland, Florida. The surviving students launch a national movement demanding action on guns.

- @parkland_back: Stand with the students
- @parkland_bipartisan: Seek a bipartisan compromise

@parkland_back
on-arrival: young_dem += 4*(1-dissent); suburban_dem += 3*(1-dissent); rural_dem -= 1*(1-dissent); dem_enthusiasm += 0.8; polarization += 0.5

Student leaders become the faces of a new civic movement.

@parkland_bipartisan
on-arrival: suburban_dem += 2*(1-dissent); gopmod_relation += 3; moderate_strength += 1; progressive_dissent += 2

A modest package of reforms passes at the state level.
